MUSIC
- None. There is no score, no backing track and no instrument in this film.
- The class's chant ("Ah, ah, ah, ah — keep him alive, keep him alive! Hundred and ten, do it again! Push, push, push, push! Hey!")
  is an ORIGINAL chant written for this film (110 BPM, A-minor chord tones), sung by the ElevenLabs voices below and assembled
  in audio/chant.py. It is not "Stayin' Alive" or "I Will Survive" and uses neither song's melody or recording.
